Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:04.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In 10 days in 1854, more than 500 people died of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.97,0:00:07.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}cholera in a few streets of London.
