Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.23,0:00:16.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Most doctors of the day blamed bad air.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.26,0:00:17.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}One doctor blamed the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.71,0:00:19.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And he went house by house to prove it.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:14.48,0:00:20.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1210 0 l 1210 132 l 0 132{\p0}
