Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:23.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The famous version of this story says a map stopped
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.24,0:00:24.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the outbreak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.02,0:00:25.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The real story is better.
