Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.48,0:01:16.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A London doctor named John Snow did not believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.77,0:01:18.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Snow was a pioneer of anesthesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.89,0:01:22.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In the 1850s, he gave chloroform to Queen Victoria
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.12,0:01:24.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}during the births of two of her children.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:13.73,0:01:19.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 910 0 l 910 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:01:13.73,0:01:19.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:01:13.73,0:01:19.48,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}JOHN SNOW · SECOND EDITION · LONDON, 1855
Dialogue: 3,0:01:13.73,0:01:19.48,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ON THE MODE OF COMMUNICATION OF CHOLERA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.89,0:01:41.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}On the night of August 31, 1854, cholera exploded in
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.83,0:01:45.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Soho, a crowded neighborhood in central London.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:38.14,0:01:43.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1210 0 l 1210 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:01:38.14,0:01:43.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:01:38.14,0:01:43.89,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}LONDON 1854 · PUBLISHED 1855 · WELLCOME COLLECTION
Dialogue: 3,0:01:38.14,0:01:43.89,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}JOHN SNOW'S MAP OF CHOLERA DEATHS AROUND BROAD STREET
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.66,0:02:04.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Snow suspected the water right away, and the pump on
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.78,0:02:05.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Broad Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.56,0:02:09.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}When he first looked at its water, it seemed almost clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.05,0:02:12.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Over the next 2 days, he saw small white particles in it.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:01.91,0:02:07.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1210 0 l 1210 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:02:01.91,0:02:07.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:02:01.91,0:02:07.66,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}LONDON 1854 · PUBLISHED 1855 · WELLCOME COLLECTION
Dialogue: 3,0:02:01.91,0:02:07.66,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}JOHN SNOW'S MAP OF CHOLERA DEATHS AROUND BROAD STREET
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.93,0:02:15.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Clear-looking water can still carry germs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.82,0:02:19.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A 1943 Army training film made the same point under
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.33,0:02:20.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}a microscope:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.22,0:02:23.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}water that looks clean can be, quote, alive with all
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.80,0:02:25.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}sorts of living matter.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:13.18,0:02:18.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1160 0 l 1160 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:02:13.18,0:02:18.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:02:13.18,0:02:18.93,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1943 · WAR DEPARTMENT · NATIONAL LIBRARY OF MEDICINE
Dialogue: 3,0:02:13.18,0:02:18.93,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. ARMY TRAINING FILM "PURIFICATION OF WATER"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.30,0:02:37.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Nearly all the deaths had happened a short distance
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.24,0:02:38.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}from the pump.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.04,0:02:40.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Only 10 were in houses clearly nearer another pump.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.98,0:02:43.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In 5 of those, the families told him they always
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.74,0:02:45.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}sent for water from Broad Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.64,0:02:46.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}They preferred it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.68,0:02:49.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}3 more were children who went to school near the pump.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:34.55,0:02:40.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1210 0 l 1210 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:02:34.55,0:02:40.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:02:34.55,0:02:40.30,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}LONDON 1854 · PUBLISHED 1855 · WELLCOME COLLECTION
Dialogue: 3,0:02:34.55,0:02:40.30,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}JOHN SNOW'S MAP OF CHOLERA DEATHS AROUND BROAD STREET
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.24,0:02:52.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Then he looked at the people who did not get sick.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:50.49,0:02:52.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1210 0 l 1210 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:02:50.49,0:02:52.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:02:50.49,0:02:52.99,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}LONDON 1854 · PUBLISHED 1855 · WELLCOME COLLECTION
Dialogue: 3,0:02:50.49,0:02:52.99,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}JOHN SNOW'S MAP OF CHOLERA DEATHS AROUND BROAD STREET
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.04,0:02:56.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The workhouse on Poland Street held 535 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.21,0:02:59.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It was almost surrounded by houses where people died
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.71,0:03:00.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}of cholera.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.45,0:03:02.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Only 5 of its inmates died.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.27,0:03:04.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The workhouse had its own well.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:53.29,0:02:59.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1210 0 l 1210 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:02:53.29,0:02:59.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:02:53.29,0:02:59.04,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}LONDON 1854 · PUBLISHED 1855 · WELLCOME COLLECTION
Dialogue: 3,0:02:53.29,0:02:59.04,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}JOHN SNOW'S MAP OF CHOLERA DEATHS AROUND BROAD STREET
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.81,0:03:07.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A brewery on Broad Street, near the pump, had more
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.60,0:03:08.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}than 70 workmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.49,0:03:11.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}None of them had cholera, at least in a severe form.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.39,0:03:14.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The owner told Snow his men drank malt liquor, not water.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.57,0:03:16.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And the brewery had a deep well of its own.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:05.06,0:03:10.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1210 0 l 1210 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:03:05.06,0:03:10.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:03:05.06,0:03:10.81,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}LONDON 1854 · PUBLISHED 1855 · WELLCOME COLLECTION
Dialogue: 3,0:03:05.06,0:03:10.81,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}JOHN SNOW'S MAP OF CHOLERA DEATHS AROUND BROAD STREET
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.24,0:03:41.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}On the evening of Thursday, September 7, Snow
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.04,0:03:44.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}presented his evidence to the parish Board of Guardians.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:38.49,0:03:44.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1210 0 l 1210 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:03:38.49,0:03:44.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:03:38.49,0:03:44.24,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}LONDON 1854 · PUBLISHED 1855 · WELLCOME COLLECTION
Dialogue: 3,0:03:38.49,0:03:44.24,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}JOHN SNOW'S MAP OF CHOLERA DEATHS AROUND BROAD STREET
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.46,0:03:58.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}First, the map came later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.23,0:04:01.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Snow first showed a map of the deaths in December 1854.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.96,0:04:04.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It appeared in his book in 1855.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.13,0:04:06.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}His suspicion of the pump came first.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:56.71,0:04:02.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1210 0 l 1210 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:03:56.71,0:04:02.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:03:56.71,0:04:02.46,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}LONDON 1854 · PUBLISHED 1855 · WELLCOME COLLECTION
Dialogue: 3,0:03:56.71,0:04:02.46,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}JOHN SNOW'S MAP OF CHOLERA DEATHS AROUND BROAD STREET
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.09,0:04:10.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}On the map, each black bar is a death at that address.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.25,0:04:13.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}You can see them stacked around the pump on Broad Street.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:07.34,0:04:13.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1210 0 l 1210 132 l 0 132{\p0}
