Dialogue: 3,0:04:07.34,0:04:13.09,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}LONDON 1854 · PUBLISHED 1855 · WELLCOME COLLECTION
Dialogue: 3,0:04:07.34,0:04:13.09,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}JOHN SNOW'S MAP OF CHOLERA DEATHS AROUND BROAD STREET
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.41,0:04:26.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Many people had fled.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.69,0:04:29.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Snow wrote that cases had dropped so far before the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.79,0:04:32.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}water was stopped that it was impossible to decide
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.83,0:04:35.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}whether the well still carried the disease.
