Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.26,0:04:58.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}a 5-month-old baby at 40 Broad Street, right beside
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.21,0:05:00.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the pump, who died on September 2.
