Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.34,0:06:02.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Each company supplied rich and poor, large houses
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.36,0:06:02.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}and small.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.97,0:06:06.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Snow saw no difference between the two groups except
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.17,0:06:06.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the water.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:59.59,0:06:05.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1103 0 l 1103 132 l 0 132{\p0}
