Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.87,0:06:27.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Snow concluded that the death rate was between 8 and
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.35,0:06:29.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}9 times higher with the dirtier water.
