Dialogue: 3,0:06:24.12,0:06:29.87,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}SNOW'S TABLE IX: CHOLERA DEATHS BY WATER COMPANY
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.35,0:06:57.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}John Snow did not live to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.35,0:06:59.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}He died in June 1858, at 45.
