Dialogue: 3,0:06:54.60,0:07:00.29,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ON THE MODE OF COMMUNICATION OF CHOLERA
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.57,0:07:55.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Cities cleaned their water by aerating, settling,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.71,0:07:57.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}filtering and chlorinating it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.63,0:08:01.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}That's how the Army explained it to soldiers in 1943.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:52.82,0:07:58.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1160 0 l 1160 132 l 0 132{\p0}
