Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.47,0:08:04.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Because in the field, there was no city water plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.79,0:08:07.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}So soldiers hung a canvas bag from a tripod.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.60,0:08:08.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It held 36 gallons.
