Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.27,0:08:12.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}They treated the water with chlorine, then tested a
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.02,0:08:13.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}sample to check there was enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.81,0:08:16.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The film says it took 30 minutes for the chemicals
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.51,0:08:17.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}to kill germs.
