Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.84,0:08:24.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In August 2026, during field training in South
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.89,0:08:28.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Korea, soldiers pumped water from the Imjin River,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.22,0:08:31.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}tested it and purified it with a Tactical Water
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.34,0:08:32.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Purification System.
