Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.12,0:08:36.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Preventive medicine soldiers test the water troops drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.61,0:08:39.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In Kosovo, they tested water at liaison team houses
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.73,0:08:41.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}to make sure it was safe to drink.
