Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.27,0:08:44.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And sometimes the water goes to civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.94,0:08:48.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}During a drought in Puerto Rico in 2026, National
