Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.83,0:09:45.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The WHO says safe water, basic sanitation and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.01,0:09:48.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}hygiene are essential to prevent cholera.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.91,0:09:51.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}John Snow pointed to the water first.
